  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Jynarque / Samsca (tolvaptan) Criteria Version 2; Original 12/11/2019; Approval 4/15/2022; Effective 2022-06-01.",
    "Encoded: two closed indications, all product-specific approval requirements and shared denials. Failure to meet approval criteria is represented by approval clauses. Clinical documentation and monitoring attestations require manual review.",
    "Cautions (notes only): serious liver injury has occurred; avoid use with underlying liver disease. Monitor for hypernatremia, dehydration, and hypovolemia. Source states dose reductions may be recommended with a moderate CYP3A inducer; wording preserved for manual review.",
    "Duration (notes only): initial approval up to 90 days; reauthorization up to 12 months. Samsca requested therapy duration ≤30 days is separately enforced.",
    "Quantity limits (notes only): Jynarque 45mg/15mg, 60mg/30mg and 90mg/30mg kits: 56 tablets per 28 days; 15mg and 30mg tablets: 30 per 30 days. Samsca 15mg: 30 tablets per 30 days; 30mg: 60 tablets per 30 days. Product-specific quantity enforcement requires manual review."
  ],
